WEBVTT

00:05:27.698 --> 00:05:31.535
So funds live in a public
blockchain treasury

00:05:31.535 --> 00:05:34.372
where anyone can audit
income and spending.

00:05:34.413 --> 00:05:37.166
And any time spending
or money transfers are involved,

00:05:37.208 --> 00:05:39.960
the DAO approves it through a proposal.

00:05:40.878 --> 00:05:43.047
Typically written by a DAO member,

00:05:43.089 --> 00:05:46.342
a proposal starts as an idea
that gets debated

00:05:46.384 --> 00:05:48.969
and is put to a vote of the token holders.

00:05:49.011 --> 00:05:50.179
For example,

00:05:50.221 --> 00:05:53.224
one of the first proposals
at CityDAO was, of course,

00:05:53.265 --> 00:05:54.975
which piece of land to buy.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:59.688
The DAO debated must-haves, nice-to-haves,

00:05:59.688 --> 00:06:03.776
and DAO contributors combed
through Wyoming land listings